OL,3,AMore flights delayed as air traffic
OL,4,Acontrol boss apologies for widespread
OL,5,Adisruption
OL,6,
OL,7,FMore flight delays are expected after
OL,8,Fan air traffic control problem in the
OL,9,FUK cancelled nearly 2,000 flights
OL,11,FTens of thousands of passengers were
OL,12,Faffected by the disruption which saw
OL,13,Fmore than 1,750 flights cancelled on
OL,14,FTuesday and a further 153 axed on
OL,15,FWednesday, according to aviation
OL,16,Fanalytics firm Cirium
OL,18,FNats, the air traffic control provider,
OL,19,Fblamed a technical glitch
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,0,100
