OL,3,AMore flights delayed as air traffic
OL,4,Acontrol boss apologies for widespread
OL,5,Adisruption
OL,6,
OL,7,FIts boss Martin Rolfe has apologised
OL,8,Fand says there will be a "very, very
OL,9,Fthorough" investigation
OL,11,FTransport Secretary Heidi Alexander has
OL,12,Fsummoned Rolfe to a meeting on
OL,13,FWednesday to answer questions about the
OL,14,Fdisruption
OL,16,FShe is also expected to tell MPs that a
OL,17,Fcyber attack was "categorically" not
OL,18,Fthe cause of the fault
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
